flowchart TB
  web[Publishers] -->|HTTP GET feeds| daemon
  gui[GUI app] -->|JSON-RPC on socket| daemon
  tui[fyke tui] -->|JSON-RPC on socket| daemon
  cli[fyke CLI] -->|JSON-RPC on socket| daemon
  shim[fyke mcp] -->|JSON-RPC on socket| daemon
  agent[Any MCP agent] -->|MCP over stdio| shim
  shell[Any shell agent] -->|runs with --json| cli
  daemon[fyke daemon] -->|sole writer| db[(SQLite + raw files)]
  daemon -->|dispatches jobs| runners[Runners: http, exec, acp]
  shell -.->|read-only SQL| db
